"**Passo 3.** Crea un classificatore potenziato quantisticamente usando "
"l'azione [`create`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/functions/multiverse-"
"computing-singularity#create).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Step 4.** Train the quantum-enhanced classifier using the "
"[`fit`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/functions/multiverse-computing-"
"singularity#fit) action.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Passo 4.** Addestra il classificatore potenziato quantisticamente usando "
"l'azione [`fit`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/functions/multiverse-"
"computing-singularity#fit).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Step 5.** Obtain predictions and probabilities from the quantum-enhanced "
